   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Confirming what you heard",
     "texto": [
      "To confirm something you have heard, as in «didn't you say that…?», use **-다면서(요)**: 가다 → **간다면서요** (didn't you say you're going?), 이사하다 → **이사한다면서요** (didn't you say you're moving house?), 좋다 → **좋다면서요** (wasn't it good?), 학생이다 → **학생이라면서요** (weren't you a student?).",
      "민수 씨, 이사**한다면서요**? = Minsu, didn't you say you're moving house?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past",
     "texto": [
      "For something that already happened, use **-았/었다면서요**: 갔다면서요 (didn't you say you went?).",
      "It is a way of checking something you have been told."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
